This project modifies DuckDuckGo for Mac
(https://github.com/duckduckgo/apple-browsers),
Copyright (c) Duck Duck Go, Inc., licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

The modifications are the commits on this repository's main branch after
the upstream release tag 1.209.0-816+macos. They change the app's bundle identifiers
and keychain names, disable telemetry and the updater, enable WebKit web
extensions, and add UI for installing and managing extensions. New source
files added by the fork carry their own copyright headers.

